{"id":"UHJvZHVjdDo5","name":"Bash II","slug":"bash-2-kacose-sacco","seoTitle":"Buy Bash 2 - Kacose Sacco | Dennis Muraguri Art Prints","seoDescription":"Shop Bash 2 - Kacose Sacco — a high quality reproduction of Dennis Muraguri matatu art.","description":"{\"time\": 1783112263567, \"blocks\": [{\"id\": \"304veg319y\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"KACOSE \\u2014 Kayole Asili Commuters Services \\u2014 runs deep into Eastlands, and the fleet reflects it. These are routes where matatus compete on spectacle: the loudest system, the boldest graffiti, the bodywork that stops pedestrians mid-stride. Bash earned its name on those streets. Bash II raised the stakes.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"id\": \"3qn4lo51b7\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"Where the original traded on nightclub energy and raw street presence, this successor pushed the visual language further \\u2014 the composition more dynamic, the nganya culture distilled into a design that commands attention even as a still image. Muraguri's 2024 woodcut catches the livery at its peak: bold confident carving, high-contrast layering, the kind of mark that only comes from a reduction process you cannot undo. Each carved layer is gone permanently. The aggression in the design is built in, not added.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"id\": \"6kseqwe9oj\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"Part of Muraguri's ongoing documentation of how Nairobi's matatu airbrush tradition evolves \\u2014 staying mobile, staying loud, staying ahead.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"id\": \"m4pyx7k5vn\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"Product Details\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"id\": \"wajllahe8d\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"Size: A3 (42 \\u00d7 29.7 cm)<br>Material: Premium 200gsm matte art paper<br>Shipping: Ships within 5 business days in protective tube<br>Framing: Sold unframed \\u2014 fits standard A3 frames\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\"}], \"version\": \"2.24.3\"}","descriptionJson":"{\"time\": 1783112263567, \"blocks\": [{\"id\": \"304veg319y\", \"data\": {\"